{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Death We Love is a short, 10 to 15 minute black &amp; white hand drawn sidescroller. It\u2019s a dark gothic cinematic adventure reflecting on how every ending makes way for something new. Hopefully inviting you to take a break and reflect on things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a skeletal horse as Death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doom the Lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regret it all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in a coffee break!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing soundtrack and hand drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by one person so expect love &amp; jank :) I do want to turn this into something bigger at some point so check it out and lmk what you think!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443910?t=1746379894","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443910/a6ec78b1094f17d7caf8cec409e71db3bd41aa7a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746379894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443910/1cb419720a2396ea86320db9432a3fc5f56be4dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746379894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443910/1cb419720a2396ea86320db9432a3fc5f56be4dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746379894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Death We Love is a short, 10 to 15 minute black &amp; white hand drawn sidescroller. It\u2019s a dark gothic cinematic adventure reflecting on how every ending makes way for something new. Hopefully inviting you to take a break and reflect on things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a sk